⚡️🇦🇺 The Royal Commission into the Integrity of Major Public and Civil Infrastructure Construction Projects in Victoria heard that the Victorian Infrastructure Delivery Agency began complying with production orders regarding their meetings over a stop work order at the Gap Road Level Crossing Removal project in June 2022.

This concludes the first week of a two week hearing block about the stop work order on the Sunbury project, which came in $6 million under budget.

